msgctxt "260"
msgid "You're Kinoshita-san, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "That's right. Who are you?"
msgstr "Ehm, esatto. Tu chi sei?"

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Kazuma Kiryu. I wanna ask you about the murder that happened\r\n"
"at this café six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Oh, that... Well, I don't know if I can tell you anything\r\n"
"new, but go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "(Let's see. What to ask...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Where were you and what were you doing when Oda was killed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"I was here, in the customer area, cleaning up. I believe you\r\n"
"can see me on the security camera tapes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "I wasn't in the locker room when the murder took place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr "Uh."

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"They say you saw Yuichi Akechi fleeing the scene on the\r\n"
"night of the crime. Tell me more about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Yes, I saw him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"That night, Akechi-kun disappeared right in the middle of\r\n"
"cleanup. I waited a while, and when he still didn't\r\n"
"come back, I went to check on him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"That's when I saw him leaving through the back door of\r\n"
"the café."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Are you sure it was Akechi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Well, I only saw his back, but I'm sure it was him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"If you didn't see his face, then how can you be so sure it\r\n"
"was Akechi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"The man I saw leave through the back door was\r\n"
"<Color:7>wearing our café's waiter's uniform<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"Aside from Oda-san, there were only three other male\r\n"
"employees working that night: Akechi-kun, a guy called\r\n"
"Asai-kun, and me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"You can see Asai-kun spending the night closing the\r\n"
"register on the security tapes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "The only person I could've seen would've been Akechi-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"After that, I called the police and waited at the back door\r\n"
"until they showed up. No one tried to enter or leave\r\n"
"during that time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"(So <Color:7>Kinoshita didn't see the criminal's face<Color:Default>...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Kinoshita's Testimony<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Did Oda have many enemies?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm not sure. I didn't really talk to him much outside\r\n"
"of work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Were your prints on the murder weapon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"No, they weren't. I keep thinking that if I had touched\r\n"
"that ashtray that day, I would've been blamed for the\r\n"
"murder..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "I'm sorry I couldn't be of more help."
msgstr "Mi spiace, non ho potuto essere di più aiuto."

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Thanks for your time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Are you a detective, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Not exactly. Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"No reason. I was just wondering why anyone would be\r\n"
"looking into that case now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"I'm trying to help a friend find out if Yuichi Akechi is\r\n"
"innocent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"Innocent? You think someone else could've been the\r\n"
"murderer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "It's possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"I see... I would feel terrible for Akechi-kun if he really\r\n"
"was innocent all this time. I can't imagine what it's like\r\n"
"to be imprisoned for a crime I didn't commit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Especially for six years... that'd be horrible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"That's why we're trying to find out the truth. If you think\r\n"
"of anything else, lemme know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Okay, I will."
msgstr "Ok, lo farò."

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Tell me more about the murder here six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "What would you like to know?"
msgstr "Cosa vuoi fare adesso?"

msgctxt "896"
msgid "(Let's see. What to ask...?)"
msgstr ""

